sequenceDiagram
    participant Product as Product<br>[implements GattClientResponse]
    participant CN as CN<br>[implements GattClient]

    Note over Product, CN: GATT operation failure and retry

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over Product, CN: Write rejected (e.g. insufficient authentication)
        Product->>CN: GattClient.WriteCharacteristic(handle=0x0025, data=0x01)
        CN-->>Product: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(error)

        Note over Product: Possible causes: insufficient authentication,<br>write not permitted, invalid handle, invalid offset.
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over Product, CN: Retry indicated by server
        Product->>CN: GattClient.ReadCharacteristic(0x0025)
        CN-->>Product: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(retry)

        Note over Product: Server is busy. Retry the same operation after a short delay.

        Product->>CN: GattClient.ReadCharacteristic(0x0025)
        CN-->>Product: GattClientResponse.ReadCharacteristicResponse(<br>data={handle=0x0025, data=0x64})
        CN-->>Product: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(success)
    end
